<title>CHILE: Mantos Blancos Copper pit signs wage deal.</title>
<headline>Mantos Blancos Copper pit signs wage deal.</headline>
<dateline>SANTIAGO 1997-04-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>Chile's Mantos Blancos copper mine has signed a 30-month collective pay deal with workers to replace an existing pact which expires in November, said a company spokesman.</p>
<p>&quot;We have signed an agreement which will last for 30 months until November 30 1999,&quot; the spokesman told Reuters.</p>
<p>The pact followed an agreement between management and unions to bring forward collective talks involving over 1,000 workers, he said.</p>
</text>
